# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# SAFETY: this repo is PUBLIC. Never commit secrets, keys, or anything
# that reveals internal network layout (IP addresses, host inventories).
# These patterns block the usual offenders from being added by mistake.
# NOTE: .gitignore only stops NEW files — it does not scrub already-tracked
# content. Keep IPs/hostnames out of files that ARE tracked (e.g. use
# templated placeholders, not literal 192.168.x.x).
# ------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- SSH: keys, configs, known hosts (internal IPs live here) ---
**/.ssh/
dot_ssh/
private_dot_ssh/
**/ssh/config
**/authorized_keys
**/known_hosts*
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ecdsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/id_dsa*
*.pem
*.ppk
*.pub

# --- atuin: sync key, session token, and local history DB are SECRET ---
**/atuin/key
**/atuin/session
**/atuin/*.db
**/atuin/history.db*

# --- Generic secrets ---
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.secret
*.crt
*.pfx
*.kdbx
**/credentials
**/*token*
**/*secret*

# --- Local cruft ---
*.bak
*.bak.*
*.tmp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
